# Fate's Edge — System Reference Document (SRD) License

This file covers the **System Reference Document (SRD)** portion of the
game content shipped in this repository — not the software source code
(see [LICENSE.code](LICENSE.code)) and not the setting-specific proprietary
content (see [LICENSE.proprietary](LICENSE.proprietary)). See
[COMMUNITY_USE_POLICY.md](COMMUNITY_USE_POLICY.md) for a plain-language
breakdown of what falls into which category and what you can/can't do
with each.

